      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-12",
      "text": "Use Responses delegation with an OpenAI model, or client delegation to connect your own backend. Voice sessions cost $0.05 per minute, billed per second; backend model and tool usage is charged separately.",
